  {
    "id": 3010002010020,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "か、果穂？　どうしたの？\r\n私、なんか変なところある？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あっ、すみません、違います！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ちょこ先輩のお団子を見てました！\r\nそれ、毎日自分で結んでるんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あ、髪のこと？　そうだよー",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わぁ……！　スゴいです！\r\nくるくるーってやるの、難しそうなのに……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "慣れちゃえば簡単簡単",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "それにこうしてまとめておけば、ちょっとの寝ぐせは\r\n誤魔化せるの。……これが大人の時短テクだよ……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "な、なるほど……！　大人の、時短テク……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010090"
  },
