  {
    "id": 3010002010100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "おいおい、あんまテキトーなこと教えんなよ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "011",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 200,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 1
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010100",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "えへへー。でも、そういう効果があるのは本当だもん\r\nお団子好きだからしてるっていうのが一番の理由だけどね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そうなんですね……！　お団子、奥が深いです……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010130,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あとあとっ、樹里ちゃんの金髪もスッゴくキレイです！\r\n自分でやったんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010140,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "いや、アタシのは美容院だよ\r\n家じゃ上手く染めらんねーからな",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わぁ……！　美容院で……！\r\nスゴいです！　あこがれちゃいます！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010160,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そっかー、果穂はそういうのが気になるお年頃かぁ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010170,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ま、髪染めんのはもうちょっと大人になってからにしな",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010180,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！　お楽しみにとっておきます！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010190,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あ！　でも、ちょこ先輩なら大丈夫ですよねっ\r\nちょこ先輩は、染めたりしないんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010200,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "金髪でお団子だったら、とっても目立ちそうです！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010210,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "それは盲点、考えたことなかった……！\r\n髪の色も個性のひとつだもんね……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010220,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "樹里ちゃんみたいな金髪だったら、キレイだし目を引くし、\r\nアイドルとしての魅力になるかも……！？",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010220"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010230,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "チョコの金髪か……染めてるとこ、あんま想像できねーな",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010230"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010240,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……やっぱり？\r\n自分でも上手くイメージできなかったんだよね……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010240"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010250,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "となると、今のままのほうがいいかなぁ\r\nほら、チョコ色だしね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010250"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010260,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "なるほど……！\r\n今の髪は、ちょこ先輩こだわりってことですね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010260"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010270,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "それじゃあ、樹里ちゃんが髪を伸ばして、\r\nお団子にするのはどうですか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010270"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010280,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "いや、アタシにロングは似合わねーだろ……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010280"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010290,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そんなことないよ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010290"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010300,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "絶対似合うと思います！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010300"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010310,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "樹里ちゃん美人さんだから、\r\nピリッとした感じでかっこよくなるんじゃないかな！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010310"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010320,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わぁ！　それってステキです！\r\nクールでカッコいい……ジャスティスブルーみたいです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010320"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010330,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "いや、ちょっ……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010330"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010340,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "きっとキレイだと思うなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010340"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010350,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ、樹里ちゃんなら！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010350"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010360,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ああっ、もう、ちょっと待てって！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010360"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010370,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシのことはいいだろ、\r\nすぐに髪が伸びるわけじゃねーんだから！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010370"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010380,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そんなことより！\r\n果穂がお団子にしてみたらいいじゃねーか！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010380"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010390,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "だってさ\r\n……果穂、どうする？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010390"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010400,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！　あたし、お団子してみたいです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010400"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010410,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "おっけー、じゃあやってあげよう！\r\nそこ座ってー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010410"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010420,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わーいっ！　ありがとうございます！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010420"
  },
  {
    "id": 3010002010430,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……はぁ\r\nレッスン前に、疲れちまった……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301000201/3010002010430"
  },
